\newlabel{fig:transport}{{4}{7}{Basis-independent transport statistics of stage~3 ($R{=}100$, $N{=}500$, massive channel removed). \textbf {Top left:} mean cosine between block increments $\Delta x_j$ and $\Delta x_k$ for a random untied stage of matched strength, the untied ConvNeXt-T and the weight-tied model. \textbf {Top right:} progress $p(t)$ along the chord $x_T-x_0$ (dashed: diagonal). \textbf {Bottom left:} survival $s_k$, the net projection of all later increments on $\Delta x_k$ in units of $\|\Delta x_k\|^2$ ($s_k<0$: later blocks oppose block $k$). \textbf {Bottom right:} alignment of each increment with the total displacement. Bands: P10--P90 over images}{figure.caption.6}{}}
